      "body": "✨ Add native OpenTelemetry support\r\n\r\nThis is designed from the beginning considering OpenTelemetry's contrib current implementation, Logfire, and Sentry.\r\n\r\nSeveral features and data extraction parts in this implementation are there so that these tools can get the data they need, but would currently acquire by monkeypatching FastAPI.\r\n\r\nIdeally, no third-party package should need/want to patch FastAPI internals (I'll change and refactor a lot of those internals soon 😅).\r\n\r\n## AI Disclaimer\r\n\r\nMade with the help of AI, using Codex with `gpt-6-astra`, manually reviewed.\r\n",
